# The emojis and the generated API secret live in the DB D1 database, the
# images in the IMAGES R2 bucket and the daily rate limit in the RATE_LIMIT KV
# namespace, all bound in wrangler.jsonc (the committed fixture render —
# wrangler provides local stand-ins behind each; `pnpm db:migrate:local`
# creates the tables — and, on deploy, rendered from the cloudflare-d1,
# cloudflare-r2 and cloudflare-kv roots' wiring documents).
#
# Replicate: without a token the site serves the gallery with a "connect
# Replicate" notice and generates nothing. For local work put your token in
# apps/web/.dev.vars (wrangler dev) or .env.local (next dev) — never commit it.
# Replicate must reach the site to deliver its webhooks, so local generation
# needs a public tunnel set as NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL.
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=r8_...
